---
const {lang='en'}=Astro.props;const z=lang==='zh';
---
<div class="shortlist-toolbar"><p>{z?'把喜欢的颜色加入清单，比较原图，再一起询问样品。':'Save the colors you like. Compare the original cards, then enquire about samples together.'}</p><button type="button" class="shortlist-open" data-open-shortlist>{z?'选色清单':'Your shortlist'} <span data-shortlist-count>0</span><span aria-hidden="true"> ↗</span></button></div>
<p id="shortlist-status" class="shortlist-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
<aside id="shortlist-tray" class="shortlist-tray" aria-label={z?'已选颜色快捷操作':'Your selected colors'} hidden><div><span class="eyebrow">{z?'已选颜色':'YOUR COLOR EDIT'}</span><strong><span data-shortlist-count>0</span> / 6</strong></div><div id="shortlist-thumbnails" aria-hidden="true"></div><button type="button" data-open-shortlist>{z?'查看与对比':'Review & compare'} ↗</button><a class="button button-light" data-shortlist-inquiry href={z?'/zh/contact/':'/contact/'}>{z?'询问样品':'Enquire about samples'} ↗</a></aside>
<dialog id="shortlist-dialog" class="shortlist-dialog" aria-labelledby="shortlist-title"><div class="color-dialog-heading"><div><p>YUNNIAN / YOUR COLOR EDIT</p><h2 id="shortlist-title">{z?'选色清单，逐款对比。':'Your colors. Side by side.'}</h2></div><button type="button" id="shortlist-close" aria-label={z?'关闭选色清单':'Close shortlist'}>×</button></div><p class="shortlist-explanation">{z?'最多保留 6 款现有产品。原图供外观对照，最终颜色与质感请核对实物样品。':'Keep up to 6 existing products. Compare the original photographs and confirm color and finish with physical samples.'}</p><div id="shortlist-grid" class="shortlist-grid"></div><div id="shortlist-empty"><p>{z?'清单还是空的。找到喜欢的色卡，点击“加入清单”。':'Your shortlist is empty. Find a color you like and select “Save color”.'}</p><button type="button" class="button button-dark" id="shortlist-browse">{z?'开始选色':'Explore colors'} ↗</button></div><div class="shortlist-dialog-footer"><p id="shortlist-storage">{z?'清单仅保存在当前浏览器，可随时移除。':'Your shortlist stays in this browser. Remove colors at any time.'}</p><button type="button" id="shortlist-clear" class="text-link">{z?'清空清单':'Clear shortlist'}</button><a class="button button-dark" data-shortlist-inquiry href={z?'/zh/contact/':'/contact/'}>{z?'用这份清单询问样品':'Enquire about these samples'} ↗</a></div></dialog>
<script>import '../scripts/color-shortlist';</script>
